OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Peppa Pig to Roman dig
OL,4,
OL,5,F"I could be the only
OL,6,Farchaeologist/Peppa Pig designer in the
OL,7,Fcountry", said Alistair Douglas.
OL,9,FHe has taken some time out as an
OL,10,Fanimator/designer to volunteer on a
OL,11,Fproject to unearth a Roman villa in
OL,12,FBedford.
OL,14,FArchaeologists, along with a human
OL,15,Frights lawyer and accountants, have
OL,16,Fbeen trying to find out what lies
OL,17,Fbeneath a plot of land on Manton Lane
OL,18,Fsince 2013.
OL,20,FOver the years the group has found roof
OL,21,Ftiles, pottery, coins, stucco work and
OL,22,Fwalls.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
